  "scope": "Repeat appearance of an oval on the rear outside wall of the Sculpted faucet shell base.",
  "observations": [
    "This circle on the back of the base of the sculpted faucet has been present since the earliest prints of it that we've done.",
    "I can't see it in the model, or even in the G-code, but maybe you can see what's happening there that's causing this.",
    "I think it's easier to see in the white faucet, so that's why I included that photo, but it's definitely still exactly the same thing on the black faucets as well."
  ],
